  "releaseNotes": "**DI024 keyed service resolution** — hosted-service reuse analysis now carries the compile-time service key through generic and direct-`typeof(T)` non-generic `GetKeyedService`/`GetRequiredKeyedService` calls. Keyed scoped services resolved once before a process-lifetime loop report, while scopes used only for the matching keyed singleton no longer warn; dynamic keys remain conservative and silent.",
